  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Hi all，</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">【守护十二星座-白羊座】活动将于4.9日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源及礼物配置。</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。<br /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">具体需求如下：</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1、 礼物配置：</span></p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 127.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 72.3pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 65.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 40.05pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 175.9pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 150.55pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"14\">白羊座-礼物墙礼物</td><td>礼物名</td><td>价格（钻）</td><td>礼物ID</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星愿小映</td><td>1314</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置，标签：新 幸</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>流光谒夜</td><td>10</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>青空猫耳酱</td><td>99</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>扑向你</td><td>333</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊星愿</td><td>520</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊座</td><td>999</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>春光共许</td><td>1314</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>缘起白羊</td><td>3344</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置，标签：新</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>凯旋吻约</td><td>5200</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊传说</td><td>13140</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>标签：高光</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>守护白羊座</td><td>33440</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>标签：高光</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊恋人</td><td>52000</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置，标签：新 高光</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>时代传奇</td><td>99999</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>标签：高光</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 58.058%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 22.0516%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 10.7459%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 9.73852%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 9.06689%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.3568%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"10\">星愿小映礼物B--长期使用</td><td>礼物名</td><td>价格（钻）</td><td>资源ID</td><td>url</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>动次打次</td><td>199</td><td>1550</td><td><a href=\"http://img.ikstatic.cn/MTU4NzQ3MDM0MjkxNCM5ODAjcG5n.png\">http://img.ikstatic.cn/MTU4NzQ3MDM0MjkxNCM5ODAjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>浪漫飞车</td><td>520</td><td>5995</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MTA3ODI1MjQxNiMgNzYjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MTA3ODI1MjQxNiMgNzYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0MTA3ODI1MjQxNiMgNzYjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>转角遇到爱</td><td>921</td><td>6284</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MTI2NjYyNTA0NiM2MTEjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MTI2NjYyNTA0NiM2MTEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc1MTI2NjYyNTA0NiM2MTEjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>蝶光城堡</td><td>1314</td><td>5839</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczNTI5NDIxMTg1NCMyMzkjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczNTI5NDIxMTg1NCMyMzkjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczNTI5NDIxMTg1NCMyMzkjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>浪漫星海</td><td>1999</td><td>6146</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTcyMzYxMDU3NSM3NjQjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTcyMzYxMDU3NSM3NjQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc0NTcyMzYxMDU3NSM3NjQjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>迪士尼花车</td><td>2666</td><td>4208</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3MDIxMjQzNjQ5MSMzMjgjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3MDIxMjQzNjQ5MSMzMjgjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY3MDIxMjQzNjQ5MSMzMjgjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>爱乐之境</td><td>5200</td><td>5743</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczMTkxNzI4NDgzNiM3MzQjcG5n.png\" title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczMTkxNzI4NDgzNiM3MzQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTczMTkxNzI4NDgzNiM3MzQjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>云端之吻</td><td>8888</td><td>4691</td><td><a title=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MDk1ODcxNDE4OCMyNjEjcG5n.png\" href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MDk1ODcxNDE4OCMyNjEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY5MDk1ODcxNDE4OCMyNjEjcG5n.png</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>环游世界</td><td>52000</td><td>1148</td><td><a href=\"http://img.ikstatic.cn/MTU2NzQwODczNDIyMyM1NDYjcG5n.png\">http://img.ikstatic.cn/MTU2NzQwODczNDIyMyM1NDYjcG5n.png</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">2、资源配置</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 102.9pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 128.9pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 32.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 340.9pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 278.4pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 59.55pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>类型</td><td>奖励名称</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td><td>备注2</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>白羊座头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>上麦动效</td><td>守护星座上麦动效</td><td>2747</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0NjAzMjgwMTYwNyM5MzIjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTY0NjAzMjgwMTYwNyM5MzIjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对背景</td><td>星座守护者派对背景</td><td>278</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwOTkyODM3NSM0NDIjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwOTkyODM3NSM0NDIjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>白羊座麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">皮肤</td><td>星座守护者私信皮肤</td><td>2227</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYyNzk4Mzg3NjgzMiM0NjEjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYyNzk4Mzg3NjgzMiM0NjEjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊座公聊皮肤</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td><td>用户榜单</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>公聊角标</td><td>白羊座公聊角标</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td><td>用户榜单</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">浮屏</td><td>星座守护者浮屏</td><td>4903</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwODUzMjQ4OCM5NTQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwODUzMjQ4OCM5NTQjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>星座守护者挂件</td><td>4904</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwODU2NTE3MSMxNDMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwODU2NTE3MSMxNDMjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>点亮</td><td>星座守护者点亮</td><td>1036</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYwNzA3NTU0MDU2NSMxMjQjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTYwNzA3NTU0MDU2NSMxMjQjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">称号</td><td>白羊座</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置，描述：完成守护十二星座（白羊座）任务获得～</td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊座代言人</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>新配置</td><td>主播榜单</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>PK背景</td><td>星座守护者PK背景</td><td>98</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwOTk3ODE2MiM5NDUjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTcxMTAwOTk3ODE2MiM5NDUjcG5n.png</a></td><td><br /></td><td>主播任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"2\">勋章</td><td>白羊流光</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>主播端、计数型、主播总榜TOP5获得</td><td>主播榜单</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>白羊星河</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户端、计数型、用户总榜TOP10获得</td><td>用户榜单</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>观众席底纹</td><td>十二星链观众席底纹</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>弹幕边框</td><td>十二星链弹幕边框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>送礼托盘</td><td>十二星链送礼托盘</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>头像框</td><td>十二星链头像框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>麦序框</td><td>十二星链麦序框</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>用户任务</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>称号</td><td>十二星链史诗</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>十二星座用户任务获得，长期在线反复使用</td><td>用户任务</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">以上，如有问题及时沟通～</p>",
